    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on the Hot Pot Challenge together in co-op or online play for up to 8 players and strive to become the ultimate hot pot champion!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience the realistic simulation of eating hot pot. Enjoy and relax in an immersive environment. Get your pot ready and savor every moment!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/d1c20d66fe6831a0fe3cc238a843efb4.avif?t=1695630325\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ONLINE MULTIPLAYER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Compete in a hot pot challenge and against other players to collect the highest scores and become the winner!</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/75f988608ea6307b3c3768966cf84206.poster.avif?t=1695630325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/75f988608ea6307b3c3768966cf84206.webm?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/75f988608ea6307b3c3768966cf84206.mp4?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chill Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Enjoy eating, relaxing with ambient sounds and customizing the environment as you like.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/71d61a3ad2e6989728da04da102c6902.poster.avif?t=1695630325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/71d61a3ad2e6989728da04da102c6902.webm?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/71d61a3ad2e6989728da04da102c6902.mp4?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Let's play something new and more fun together.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/2b8f768dc46add73a85233ea1585937e.poster.avif?t=1695630325\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/2b8f768dc46add73a85233ea1585937e.webm?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524410/extras/2b8f768dc46add73a85233ea1585937e.mp4?t=1695630325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Items Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Customize your wares as you like, pot, chopsticks, spoon, plate, bowl, glass, tray and etc.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cooking Time (Coming soon)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on the role of a chef, preparing dishes according to the order list.</li></ul>",
